\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {II}{\ignorespaces Reconstruction accuracy on GM12878 chromosome~22 (701{} bins, 50~kb), all methods scored by dSCC over the same observed pairs, mean\,$\pm $\,std over 3{} seeds (ShRec3D deterministic). TAD $F_1$ is boundary reproducibility; time is per-run wall-clock on CPU. Best mean in bold. $\ddagger $: the published FLAMINGO~\cite  {flamingo2022} run at 50~kb, below its native 1--5~kb resolution; its short-range ($\le $1~Mb) dSCC is $0.51$ and global dSCC is dominated by the long-range pairs its coarse backbone handles least well (see text).}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:benchmark}{{II}{5}{}{table.2}{}}
