\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Agreement with single-molecule FISH distances as the input Hi-C is downsampled (right to left, log axis) for IMR90 and K562 chromosome~21. GenoFold holds close to its full-depth accuracy across two orders of magnitude of coverage, while the distance optimizers 3DMax and ShRec3D degrade sharply below roughly 10\% of contacts. Raw Hi-C is the thinned contact matrix scored directly, without reconstruction.}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:fishsparse}{{2}{6}{}{figure.2}{}}
